      "1. Onthis IBIS model name selection, the fragment “XX” on “io8pXX_ar3wsudq_ft_pu_lv” defines the speed. 00 = low speed, 01 = medium speed, 10 = fast speed, 11 = high speed. Refer to column “Buffer speed” in this table.",
